== limitations and work in progress
- rise, fall, delay in $transition are constant.
- delay in $absdelay is a constant.
- no refcounting in hierarchical refs, use with care
  c.f. mg_href.nest0.gc
- localparam not considered in overloading
- ac needs operating point, even if linear:
  c.f. mg2_cccs.0.gc
- $write etc. not working in analog functions
- net assign: only nodes in rhs expression
- net assign: delay arg is constant

== modelgen
- dependency tracking glitch aka rram bug
- ddx, flow(<port>): no derivatives (feature?)
- filter contribution to potential, uses internal node.
- cleanup hack breaks detach_all
- `default_transition missing, and some step control
- bogus error message on wrong filter args
- seems to crash on V(x) if x is parameter.
- v_instance: port name issue with case insensitive
- hsp does not play well with paramset
- should reject named blocks in analog functions

== simulator plugins
- missing localparam rules in overload
- paramset: requires newlines, v_paramset.2a.gc
- not (yet) instanciating unused modules

